{"4574510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PROJECT REPRIEVE", "steam_appid": 4574510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you repent for your sins? Or is a flawless Reprieve something you can't fathom?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET YOUR MAIN MAN, NIKO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boastful, headstrong, and quick-on-his-feet, Niko is the (unfortunate) main character! Tasked with saving his friends and family from eternal damnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574510/extras/62e2cfee4820935cf49746a05ff5f360.avif?t=1783708719\" width=1150 height=850 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAT UP WEIRDOS AND DEMONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a rock, electric shocks,<strong> a gun</strong> and your bare hands to fend off the demons trying to kill you. Survive until 6 AM and make another lap around until Ms. Yahweh says you've reprieved enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574510/extras/2d61fc99e74844b489d7639599c370ae.avif?t=1783708719\" width=1150 height=850 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEE A MYRIAD OF FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no end to the onslaught of Demons, Manifestations, Aberrations and even Damned Souls that will be thrown at you in this hectic game, with 20+ enemies to unlock (and some secret bonus collaboration characters), you'll hardly find yourself struggling to be uninterested</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574510/extras/cc0e0f300b1e66e33c8883986d502667.avif?t=1783708719\" width=1150 height=850 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET ACHIEVEMENTS, AND HIGH SCORES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph